---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Pricing
eyebrow: Services
subtitle: Project Broadsheet is free. If you want help, I sell my time.
permalink: /pricing/
---
<div class="lead" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
  Project Broadsheet exists so you don't need me. The framework is free, the documentation covers everything, and anyone with a terminal and a GitHub account can run a full publication at no cost. If you'd rather have help, I'm happy to sell my time - but at a fair freelance rate, not a platform markup.
</div>

<section class="pricing-section">
  <header class="pricing-section__header">
    <h2 class="pricing-section__title">Self-hosted</h2>
    <p class="pricing-section__summary">Fork the repository and deploy it yourself. Every feature ships by default. There is no "pro tier" holding anything back - the documentation is written specifically so you can do all of this on your own.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="pricing-free">
    <div>
      <span class="pricing-free__price">{{ pricing.selfHosted.price }}<span class="pricing-free__cadence">{{ pricing.selfHosted.cadence }}</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="pricing-free__body">
      <h3>{{ pricing.selfHosted.name }}</h3>
      <p>{{ pricing.selfHosted.tagline }}</p>
      <ul class="pricing-card__list">
        {% for f in pricing.selfHosted.features %}<li>{{ f }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="{{ pricing.selfHosted.cta.url }}">{{ pricing.selfHosted.cta.label }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pricing-section" id="hosting">
  <header class="pricing-section__header">
    <h2 class="pricing-section__title">Hosting</h2>
    <p class="pricing-section__summary">If you'd rather not manage a Cloudflare account yourself, I'll host your site on mine. Flat rate, no tiers.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="pricing-free">
    <div>
      <span class="pricing-free__price">{{ pricing.hosting.price }}<span class="pricing-free__cadence">{{ pricing.hosting.cadence }}</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="pricing-free__body">
      <p>{{ pricing.hosting.tagline }}</p>
      <ul class="pricing-card__list">
        {% for f in pricing.hosting.features %}<li>{{ f }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="{{ pricing.hosting.cta.url }}">{{ pricing.hosting.cta.label }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pricing-section" id="my-time">
  <header class="pricing-section__header">
    <h2 class="pricing-section__title">My time</h2>
    <p class="pricing-section__summary">Everything else - setup, migration, training, consulting, custom development, support - is billed at a single rate. You pay for what you actually need, nothing more.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="pricing-free">
    <div>
      <span class="pricing-free__price">{{ pricing.hourly.price }}<span class="pricing-free__cadence">{{ pricing.hourly.cadence }}</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="pricing-free__body">
      <p>{{ pricing.hourly.tagline }}</p>
      <ul class="pricing-card__list">
        {% for item in pricing.hourly.includes %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="{{ pricing.hourly.cta.url }}">{{ pricing.hourly.cta.label }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="callout" style="margin-top: var(--space-2xl);">
  <div class="callout__title">One person on the other end</div>
  <p>Every engagement is with me directly. No bots, no AI, no sales team. If you write, I reply. If you book a call, I'm on it. That also means I'm selective - I take on work I can do well, for individuals and organizations whose work I think matters.</p>
</div>
